    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lustful Fingers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the massage of your dreams.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a skilled masseur and welcome a variety of unique and beautiful female clients to your luxurious spa. Each client brings a different story, dialogue, and preferences. Can you relax their bodies while touching their souls?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this journey:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master advanced massage techniques</strong>: Muscle relaxation, joint manipulation, hot stone therapies, and even romantic moments in the jacuzzi. Decide which areas to focus on and how to treat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438100/extras/ec53ccfc4b8f784e5d3476a451bbd7d5.avif?t=1755108445\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build deeper connections</strong>: Develop bonds with your clients, uncover their stories, and take your relationships to more intimate levels. But remember, every client is different, and finding the right rhythm is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in realistic massage mechanics</strong>: Receive real-time feedback as you hone your techniques. Your every move affects your clients' responses and satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438100/extras/f111f5e564da82324b6fcd479860edc7.avif?t=1755108445\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a blend of luxury and eroticism</strong>: Indulge in a warm, inviting spa atmosphere with soft lighting, creating a mix of relaxation and allure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438100/extras/9acf9befdf2d234399386a3f6e37e373.avif?t=1755108445\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your relationships are in your hands:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some clients may be eager to move things forward quickly, while others will test your patience and skills. Your choices will shape their interest in you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore your own spa world and embark on an unforgettable journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Designed exclusively for adult players, </i><strong>Lustful Fingers</strong><i> offers a unique blend of simulation and adult content.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438100/extras/7a5fee3e851d7a0dd8c3225575652a23.avif?t=1755108445\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
